## Hello, world

After a while, *Ninjas.cl* has a site of its own again.

This is the starting point of our new blog engine, built with
[Gleam](https://gleam.run/) and [blogatto](https://blogat.to/). From here we
will publish notes about our experiments, video games, software and anything
else we happen to be building.

See you soon. 🥷
